WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:06.930
This is a man who literally transforms into
the Buddha, the most powerful and wise being

00:00:06.930 --> 00:00:10.390
in Japanese and Chinese mythology.

00:00:10.390 --> 00:00:18.099
Because this golden and slightly overweight
form is that of a mythical human Zoan fruit,

00:00:18.099 --> 00:00:24.210
arguably the most rare and dangerous type
of Devil Fruit in the entire story that we

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:30.029
only get to see in action this one time here
at the peak of Marineford, one of the most

00:00:30.029 --> 00:00:34.649
turbulent and exciting arcs in all of Anime
and Manga.

00:00:34.649 --> 00:00:38.859
But this man is so much more.

00:00:38.859 --> 00:00:44.450
Fighting side by side with Luffy's grandfather
Garp, against the likes of Rocks Whitebeard

00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:49.039
and Shiki, and respected by the Pirate king
himself for his power.

00:00:49.039 --> 00:00:55.780
The Buster call on Ohara, a fleet of devastating
Navy Ships sent to destroy the island of scholars,

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:57.870
summonsed at his command.

00:00:57.870 --> 00:01:01.329
Unforgivable, I am personally insulted.

00:01:01.329 --> 00:01:08.200
Smashing Garp head-first into the ground to
keep him from attacking Akainu, who just murdered

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:09.220
his grandson.

00:01:09.220 --> 00:01:13.049
Ending the war to stop unnecessary bloodshed.

00:01:13.049 --> 00:01:15.390
Handing in his resignation to Kong.

00:01:15.390 --> 00:01:18.960
Keeping a picture of Corazon is his drawer.

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:24.430
And having a long and sincere conversation
about him with Law on Dressrosa, after he

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:26.700
and Luffy took down Doflamingo.

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:34.880
And since Corazon was his foster son and Law
Corazon's, these two are basically the weirdest

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:40.390
and most awkward Grandpa-grandson duo of all
time.

00:01:40.390 --> 00:01:48.380
Looking at a before and after, he is without
any doubt the character that aged the most

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:52.100
over the two year time skip, well, together
with Koby I guess.

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:57.479
He retired from his position arguing that
a change was necessary and almost seems to

00:01:57.479 --> 00:02:03.720
be a completely different person now, eating
crackers like Garp and generally going against

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:06.979
his former extremely strict and serious behavior.

00:02:06.979 --> 00:02:13.010
By the way, this video contains spoilers for
the one piece manga, so if you need to leave,

00:02:13.010 --> 00:02:15.239
do it now, but otherwise:

00:02:15.239 --> 00:02:22.150
Welcome to this breakdown of fleet admiral
Sengoku, well...ex-fleet admiral.

00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:28.260
My name is Manu, and now that we have all
bathed in the glory of Luffy's legendary mythical

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:34.200
Zoan devil fruit reveal right here, I got
extremely excited to look deeper into the

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:37.709
deeper meaning of this power in the story.

00:02:37.709 --> 00:02:42.909
And this golden grandpa, who by the way is
the only other official mythical human devil

00:02:42.909 --> 00:02:49.590
fruit in the entire story so far next to our
Rubbery Hero, has been on my list for a while

00:02:49.590 --> 00:02:50.590
now.

00:02:50.590 --> 00:02:55.349
Because looking back now, through the lens
of a completely different One PIece and against

00:02:55.349 --> 00:03:00.990
everything I believed in prior to this, it
looks to me like Sengoku was not only a character

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:07.330
with a more than fascinating character arc,
but that he might end up being one of the

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:11.409
most important characters in the story.

00:03:11.409 --> 00:03:17.080
Someone who might play a central role in taking
down the world government, as paradoxical

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:18.970
as it may sound.

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:23.129
Let's go back to the image of a giant golden
Buddha here.

00:03:23.129 --> 00:03:28.709
I think to really drive home how big of a
deal this devil fruit is, it's worth pointing

00:03:28.709 --> 00:03:34.319
out once again, that Buddhism play a central
role in One Piece.

00:03:34.319 --> 00:03:41.220
Zoro's character and fighting style is heavily
based on Buddhism and the six paths.

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:47.159
Luffy's appearance as the wisdom king in Wano,
Enel's buddha from and a number of other buddhist

00:03:47.159 --> 00:03:51.440
deities can be found throughout the story.

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:58.040
And the similarity of Imu's name to the Kanji
for the Buddha, is by far one of the most

00:03:58.040 --> 00:04:03.960
prominent and consistent sources of speculations
I come across in the Japanese One Piece community.

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:11.459
At the climax of the Marineford war, as Luffy
finally reaches Ace, Sengoku transforms, and

00:04:11.459 --> 00:04:13.970
berries the Rubber boy under his palm.

00:04:13.970 --> 00:04:20.270
On the one hand this is reference to the Journey
of the west, a major inspiration for One PIece,

00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:25.850
where the monkey king sun wukong is also buried
under the palm of the Buddha, the ultimate

00:04:25.850 --> 00:04:26.850
being.

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:34.090
ON the other hand, knowing about Luffy's true
nature now, I think it was also fantastic

00:04:34.090 --> 00:04:35.700
foreshadowing.

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:42.360
The reveal of the the first mythical human-type
zoan devil fruit is in direct contact with

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:43.360
Luffy.

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:49.320
Two powerful deities going head to head, even
though we weren't aware of that fact yet.

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:54.540
Also, when I look at the list of some other
mythical Zoan fruit users in the story, Marco,

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:59.310
Kaido, Momo, Luffy and Yamato, an interesting
pattern emerges.

00:04:59.310 --> 00:05:04.970
One reason I speculated that Luffy might be
a Zoan fruit before the official reveal, was

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:10.920
the story of Momotaro, where the boy Momotaro
goes on a quest to defeat an Oni wth the help

00:05:10.920 --> 00:05:15.580
of a monkey, a dog and a bird.

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:22.300
Though admittedly pure speculation, I think
it would be plausable that a story line surrounding

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:28.930
the Buddha and the journey to the west could
involve mythical devil fruit users as well.

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:54.390
We already have Sun Wukong with Monkey D.
Luffy and of course the Buddha himself.

00:05:54.390 --> 00:06:10.770
I 

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:23.150
have read 

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:40.470
a few Japanese theories that claim that Sengoku
will either fight by Luffy's side at some

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:46.310
point or even join the revolutionary army,
on way or the other supporting the family

00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:49.470
of his friend garp, who he failed during the
war.

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:53.430
Some even see him as the secret leader of
sword.

00:06:53.430 --> 00:07:01.060
I'm not sure I would go that far, but I think
it's fair to assume that Sengoku will be a

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:03.280
force of good going forward.

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:09.660
Because we've been talking about all that
and I haven't even discussed Sengoku's subtle,

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:13.340
but surprisingly impactful character development
arc.

00:07:13.340 --> 00:07:19.840
You see this here, holding down Garp to keep
him from taking revenge, as much as I might

00:07:19.840 --> 00:07:26.060
have disliked him for it in that very moment,
is the face of someone tormented by his own

00:07:26.060 --> 00:07:27.060
responsibility.

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:32.950
On the surface, Sengoku falls into the same
category as Garp, X-Drake, Coby or Aokiji.

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:38.860
The good boy squad of the Marines if you will,
that show what this organisation is supposed

00:07:38.860 --> 00:07:45.170
to be, a force for good, that holds the safety
and freedom of all the people as its most

00:07:45.170 --> 00:07:47.070
sacred ideal.

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:52.920
This stands in stark contrast to Akainu's
absolute justice, that doesn't shy away from

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:56.520
killing deserters or civilians.

00:07:56.520 --> 00:08:03.720
Or even worse, the world government, that
uses the Marines as a tool to keep the kleptocratic

00:08:03.720 --> 00:08:08.530
domination of a few, that live and rule at
the cost of everyone else.

00:08:08.530 --> 00:08:15.140
And yet, even though the ultimate power lies
with Kong, The Gorosei and Imu, Sengoku himself

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:20.040
has been at the top of this organisation for
many years.

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:25.590
He has carried out countless missions in the
name of justice and ordered even more as fleet

00:08:25.590 --> 00:08:30.280
admiral, commanding the governments most powerful
fighters.

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:35.080
I think it is clear, that personally Sengoku
has always been fighting for the sake of the

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:38.630
people and against the cruelty of many of
the pirates.

00:08:38.630 --> 00:08:44.740
We see him going through documents, tolerating
the Yonko and even the system of the warlords.

00:08:44.740 --> 00:08:49.250
He orders the buster call on Ohara, where
the researchers have uncovered parts of the

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:51.890
forbidden history.

00:08:51.890 --> 00:08:58.800
Sengoku's credo is Kunrin seigi, which the
wiki translates as reigning justice, which

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:02.441
if you ask me makes no sense at all.

00:09:02.441 --> 00:09:09.020
I personally believe Kunrin in this context
is much better described as controlling justice.

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:14.800
In other words, he thinks, that it's the job
of the marines to keep the world in balance

00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:20.010
and and that all decisions should be made
in the name of keeping the more or less stable

00:09:20.010 --> 00:09:21.330
status quo.

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:25.870
Even if it means tolerating Doflamingo, who
killed his foster son Corazon.

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:31.490
Even if it means stopping his best and oldest
friend in the entire world from getting revenge

00:09:31.490 --> 00:09:34.280
for having his family member killed.

00:09:34.280 --> 00:09:40.310
And even if it means destroying an entire
island, if it will keep the world from knowing

00:09:40.310 --> 00:09:44.510
the true history and falling into chaos.

00:09:44.510 --> 00:09:50.790
And he has to balance his own sense of justice
with the wishes of the government.

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:54.480
Basically Sengoku is what Garp could have
been.

00:09:54.480 --> 00:10:00.640
Rising becoming and admiral and ultimately
fleet admiral, coming under the direct control

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:05.580
of the celestial dragons and burdened with
the responsibilities and restrictions that

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:07.090
come with that position.

00:10:07.090 --> 00:10:12.510
And so I think it's no big surprise, that
the three biggest moments of change for Sengoku

00:10:12.510 --> 00:10:14.290
were the Ohara incident.

00:10:14.290 --> 00:10:18.800
The Summit War and the defeat of Doflamingo
by Law and Luffy.

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:24.390
The incident of Ohara was a major blow to
Sengoku's image of the marines and the government

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:26.690
as a whole.

00:10:26.690 --> 00:10:31.161
He understood that the knowledge about the
true history couldn't be made public, even

00:10:31.161 --> 00:10:34.590
if it wasn't for the same reasons as the Gorosei.

00:10:34.590 --> 00:10:39.700
While they wanted to keep their own name clean
and keep their legitimacy to rule, Sengoku

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:44.850
saw it as a necessary step to keep the balance
and avoid chaos and war.

00:10:44.850 --> 00:10:50.470
So while he ordered the buster call, he also
organised the evacuation ship for all the

00:10:50.470 --> 00:10:55.080
citizens of the island, that should have taken
everyone off Ohara.

00:10:55.080 --> 00:10:58.280
But then two things happened.

00:10:58.280 --> 00:11:03.710
Dr. Clover was prepared to say the name of
the true history to everyone present, to which

00:11:03.710 --> 00:11:10.000
the government ordered him to be taken out,
while Akainu, who was already radicalised

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:18.110
at this point, sank the evacuation vessel
without batting an eye.

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:24.370
This brutality towards unarmed people and
civilians must have left Sengoku questioning

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:28.750
the meaning of Justice and the true nature
of those he served.

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:34.240
His ideal was clearly to be a moderate leader
and influence in a world where both piracy

00:11:34.240 --> 00:11:39.120
and the marines were becoming more and more
extreme in there views and actions.

00:11:39.120 --> 00:11:43.450
That was the same year that Roger died as
well.

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:50.690
A great example of how times changed after
these two major events is the trial of Franky's

00:11:50.690 --> 00:11:54.540
father figure tom, who was trialed for building
Roger's ship.

00:11:54.540 --> 00:12:01.170
As the judge himself notes, this was not very
common at that time, marking a change in the

00:12:01.170 --> 00:12:04.310
the world that Sengoku was trying to fight.

00:12:04.310 --> 00:12:10.380
I think it's fair to assume then, that Marineford
war, the death of whitebeard and ace and the

00:12:10.380 --> 00:12:18.540
mass breakout of Impel Down buried his hopes
for keeping the balance of the world.

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:23.529
He must have felt like he failed what he set
out to do and thus decided it was time to

00:12:23.529 --> 00:12:24.529
step down.

00:12:24.529 --> 00:12:29.420
This not only made sense for Sengoku I think,
but also from a storytelling perspective,

00:12:29.420 --> 00:12:35.900
as the radical Akainu, the man who killed
his brother Ace, will make a much better antagonist

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:41.280
to Luffy, rather than a morally good person,
who wants peace for the citizens above all

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:42.370
else.

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:48.030
Not a kind and calm Buddha, but a boiling
pile of Lava.

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:54.170
This marks the start of Sengoku's enlightenment
if you will, a falling out of love with what

00:12:54.170 --> 00:13:00.110
the government and the marines actual represent
in the world and warming him up to Luffy and

00:13:00.110 --> 00:13:02.190
the change he is bringing.

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:09.020
It it this island however, Dressrosa, that
brought the biggest point of development yet

00:13:09.020 --> 00:13:10.480
for his character.

00:13:10.480 --> 00:13:15.370
Before I start speculating about Sengoku,
here are the facts from the manga.

00:13:15.370 --> 00:13:19.600
- He displays an outright hatred for Doflamingo.

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:24.320
- He trusts Corazon enough to share highly
sensitive information with him, including

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:25.880
the Donquixote Crew's location.

00:13:25.880 --> 00:13:29.240
- He keeps a foto of Corazon in his desk drawer.

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:36.800
I think the manga has been extremely suggestive,
that Corazon was basically a son to Sengoku.

00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:41.480
It seems like he was raised and cared for
by the former fleet admiral.

00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:48.210
Sengoku, who keeps Garp from killing akainu
and who always puts his duty first, showing

00:13:48.210 --> 00:13:53.830
this level of aggression towards Dofi, is
extremely telling I think.

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:59.589
Especially because he doesn't show anything
remotely similar for people like Moria and

00:13:59.589 --> 00:14:04.410
co, who arguable aren't any better than Doflamingo.

00:14:04.410 --> 00:14:10.890
The photo scene also was very interesting
to me, because nothing ever came of it.

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:17.400
Vergo didn't find out about Corazon by seeing
it, so it's purpose clearly was showing us

00:14:17.400 --> 00:14:23.120
that Sengoku keeps an image of this person
in the same drawer where he keeps the most

00:14:23.120 --> 00:14:26.730
important and confidential things and documents
to him.

00:14:26.730 --> 00:14:32.270
The fact that he trusts Corazon so much, especially
after all he has lived through during his

00:14:32.270 --> 00:14:38.720
lifetime speaks volumes for the relationship
they had as well.

00:14:38.720 --> 00:14:44.210
The most heartbreaking thing ever, is the
scene where Corazon hangs up on Sengoku, who

00:14:44.210 --> 00:14:50.200
opens up this drawer to look at a foto of
his son, because hearing his voice made him

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:52.360
want to see his face.

00:14:52.360 --> 00:14:57.720
Clearly it's a relationship built heavily
on love and trust, that shined a completely

00:14:57.720 --> 00:15:00.410
new light on Sengoku as a person for me.

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:06.220
And this gets even more interesting in his
interaction with Law on dressrosa.

00:15:06.220 --> 00:15:08.209
Again let's look at the facts first.

00:15:08.209 --> 00:15:14.630
- Law, who usually is rude and disrespectful,
is only polite and affectionate in his Japanese

00:15:14.630 --> 00:15:16.660
towards two people, ever.

00:15:16.660 --> 00:15:20.839
Corazon and when he meets Sengoku on Dresssrosa.

00:15:20.839 --> 00:15:25.759
He doesn't mutter a single insult, even once.
- he hates the marines.

00:15:25.759 --> 00:15:31.800
- Law sees Corazon as his parent figure, that
he loves and cherishes so much, he not only

00:15:31.800 --> 00:15:37.160
named his crew after him and has his face
as a tattoo across his chest, but he also

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:41.970
made it his life's mission to get back to
doflamingo.

00:15:41.970 --> 00:15:49.619
- Sengoku was in disbelief that Corazon disobeyed
him for law's sake.

00:15:49.619 --> 00:15:54.649
- He tells law, that he would love that arrest
him and that he dates that Law is the only

00:15:54.649 --> 00:15:56.980
person he can talk about Corazon with.

00:15:56.980 --> 00:16:02.370
Basically, Sengoku blames Law to a certain
extend for the loss of his son, while at the

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:08.700
same time recognising and respecting that
Law was to Corazon, what Corazon was to him.

00:16:08.700 --> 00:16:15.810
And more importantly, that he exposed and
defeated Doflamingo and bringing both of them

00:16:15.810 --> 00:16:16.810
closure.

00:16:16.810 --> 00:16:21.779
He ensures Law, that Corazon didn't save him
for being a D, but simply because he love

00:16:21.779 --> 00:16:22.779
him.

00:16:22.779 --> 00:16:27.320
And the fact that he is able to let Law go
and take away his doubts about his father

00:16:27.320 --> 00:16:33.310
figure really shows how much Sengoku has grown.

00:16:33.310 --> 00:16:40.990
He allows a pirate, who confessed to him to
be of the D clan, to leave, just as Fujitora

00:16:40.990 --> 00:16:48.070
is doing with Luffy and finally overcomes
his own strict ideals, being able to see the

00:16:48.070 --> 00:16:51.610
good in what these two pirates have done together.

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:55.740
But to really understand the beauty of this
scene, you should really watch this video

00:16:55.740 --> 00:17:00.230
on Law, where I explain everything there is
to know about his increadible character arc

